title: 'Statement store: Latency bench cli sudo'
doc:
- audience: Todo
  description: |-
    # Description

    Extend the statement-latency-bench CLI tool to automatically set up per-account statement allowances via sudo extrinsics

    Added subxt-based sudo call to system.set_storage that writes :statement_allowance: keys for each benchmark account

    Updated the grafana dashboard and Metrics.md
